.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH mnnn-export 1  "mnnn-export 2.16.0" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
mnnn\-export \- Export bars
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmnnn export\fR <\fB\-\-format\fR> [\fB\-\-home\fR] [\fB\-\-db\fR] <\fB\-\-out\fR> [\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR] [\fB\-\-symbol\fR] [\fB\-\-source\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-\-from\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-to\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-duration\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Export bars
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
csv
.IP \(bu 2
parquet
.IP \(bu 2
json
.IP \(bu 2
html: A document: a summary and every bar per series
.IP \(bu 2
latex
.IP \(bu 2
pdf
.IP \(bu 2
docx
.IP \(bu 2
text
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-home\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Muninn home directory (default ~/.muninn)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_HOME\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Database file (default <home>/storage/muninn.database)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_DB\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-out\fR \fI<OUT>\fR
Output path, or `\-` for stdout (csv/json/text)
.TP
\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR
Never prompt; missing values are errors
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_NON_INTERACTIVE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-symbol\fR \fI<SYMBOL>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-source\fR \fI<SOURCE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
More output (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-from\fR \fI<FROM>\fR

.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print nothing but errors and requested data
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_QUIET\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-to\fR \fI<TO>\fR

.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Answer yes to every confirmation
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_YES\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-duration\fR \fI<DURATION>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR \fI<THEME_MODE>\fR
Override the theme mode for this run
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
light
.IP \(bu 2
dark
.IP \(bu 2
system
.RE
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_THEME_MODE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH VERSION
v2.16.0
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmnnn\fR(1)
